{"c":[{"id":"9d643efe7d7e9cc8","sum":"uv lock --locked without --refresh accepts a pytorch-index lock as current, so the root docs lock uses --no-config --refresh. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only handoff to query.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T191535Z-13e9bab5c49f07d0","text":"uv lock --locked without --refresh treats a pytorch-index lock as current; root docs lock must use --no-config --refresh.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T193807Z-4efc5d97f1279b70","text":"stockroom semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only shape that can hand off to query.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20fe4911ab451244","sum":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked; uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision to 3. CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194958Z-1341312456d701ec","text":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked. uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision back to 3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T195915Z-9e5f10b38f9fb742","text":"CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
